'''Wushu Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]]. He was added in [[Version 9.0 Update|Version 9.0]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 10.5 Update|Version 10.5]] increases health and gains slow immunity. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 14.0 Update|Version 14.0]].

