==Trivia==
*Wushu means "Martial Arts" (武術 in Traditional Chinese, 武术 in Simplified Chinese), Sifu means "Master" (師父 in Traditional Chinese, 师父 in Simplified Chinese), and Shigong means "Grandmaster" (師公 in Traditional Chinese, 师公 in Simplified Chinese).
*Wushu Cat's hairstyle and robe appear to be based on the male [https://dragon-quest.org/wiki/Martial_Artist Martial Artist] from ''[[wikipedia:Dragon Quest III|Dragon Quest III]]''.
*The Chinese character on Wushu Cat's robe and the third hit of Shigong Cat's attack (猫) means "cat".

